# Both players grab one box in the same tick: the first claim wins, the other is refused.
scenario grab_dispute
scene two_chars_item
seed 21
guests 1
settle 6s

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 10ms

p0 walk box
p1 walk box
at 3s p0 grab box as g0
at 3s p1 grab box as g1
at 4s p0 throw 2 1 0 speed 6 as pass

expect one_of granted g0 g1
expect one_of refused g0 g1
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 5deg
expect no_stuck
